<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela Venprecar first half net drops.</title>
<headline>Venezuela Venprecar first half net drops.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1st half 1997	 1st half 1996</p>
<p>    Net profit		$9.42 million	   $11.75 million</p>
<p>    Net sales		 $39.71 million	  $38.73 million</p>
<p>    Cost of sales	   $27.29 million	  $27.10 million</p>
<p>    Administrative costs   $3.24 million	   $3.62 million</p>
<p>NOTE: Results to period ending March 31 are consolidated.</p>
<p>Venezolana de Prerreducidos Caroni CA, Venprecar, is a hot briquetted iron producer and a subsidiary of Venezuela's leading steel company Siderurgica Venezolana Sivensa SACA.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
